<p>Hi,</p>

<p>
  The nightly check ran on <strong><%= @run_date %></strong>. There
  <%= @expenses.size == 1 ? "is" : "are" %> <strong><%= @expenses.size %> approved
  <%= "expense".pluralize(@expenses.size) %></strong> waiting to be built into a batch.
</p>

<% if @flagged_count.to_i.positive? %>
  <p>
    <%= @flagged_count %> of <%= @flagged_count == 1 ? "them needs" : "them need" %> a look on
    the <%= link_to "Review page", admin_reimbursements_review_url(tab: "approved", cost_centre: @cost_centre.key) %> first: the <strong>Needs attention</strong> column below says why.
  </p>
<% end %>

<p>
  Nothing has been submitted automatically. When you're ready, open
  <%= link_to "Build Batch", new_admin_reimbursements_batch_url(cost_centre: @cost_centre.key) %>
  to create the EUSA draft, then review and send it.
</p>

<p><strong><%= link_to "Approved queue", admin_reimbursements_review_url(tab: "approved", cost_centre: @cost_centre.key) %>:</strong></p>
<%= render "reimbursements/emails/claims_table", expenses: @expenses, total: @total, needs_attention: true %>

<% if @next_run_day.present? %>
  <p>The next scheduled check is <%= @next_run_day %>.</p>
<% end %>

<p>Best,<br><%= @cost_centre.automated_sign_off %></p>
